		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Bonjour,</p><p>J&#039;ai une table1 avec :</p><p>date&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;value<br />01/01/2020 00:00:00&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 0<br />01/01/2020 01:00:00&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 0<br />01/01/2020 02:00:00&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 0<br />01/01/2020 03:00:00&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 0<br />01/01/2020 04:00:00&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 5<br />01/01/2020 05:00:00&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 5<br />01/01/2020 06:00:00&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 5<br />01/01/2020 07:00:00&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 0<br />01/01/2020 08:00:00&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 0<br />01/01/2020 09:00:00&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 2&#160; <br />01/01/2020 10:00:00&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 2<br />01/01/2020 11:00:00&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 2<br />01/01/2020 12:00:00&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 2</p><p>Comment traduire :<br />Si dernière ligne &quot;value&quot; = 0 alors extrait la dernière ligne sinon extraire la ligne qui suit le dernier &quot;0&quot; de la colonne value.</p><p>Dans cet exemple c&#039;est &quot;01/01/2020 09:00:00&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 2&#160; &quot;</p><br /><br /><p>Merci de votre aide.</p>]]></content>
